{"id":"f5c55ddf2aa11f80","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-structure.md","title":"一阶语言的结构解释","display":"df-structure — 一阶语言的结构解释","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-structure","aliases":["43-df-structure"],"display":"df-structure — 一阶语言的结构解释","depends_on":["[[43-df-first-order-language]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-structure — 一阶语言的结构解释"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"809479f98d99c157\" href=\"?note=809479f98d99c157\" title=\"43-df-first-order-language\">43-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\">\\(L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_L\">\\(S_L\\)</span> 为下式定义的非逻辑符号集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>为集合，I为定义域S_L上的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,I)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,I)\\)</span>。在解释记号的定义式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in L_{\\rm Const}\">\\(c\\in L_{\\rm Const}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\">\\(f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\">\\(R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\\)</span>，并以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\\)</span> 为前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_L:=L_{\\rm Const}\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(L_{\\rm Func,n}\\cup L_{\\rm Rel,n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_L:=L_{\\rm Const}\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(L_{\\rm Func,n}\\cup L_{\\rm Rel,n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A,I\\ \\Bigl(\\mathfrak A=(A,I)\\land A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{dom}(I)=S_L\\land\\forall c\\in L_{\\rm Const}\\ (I(c)\\in A)\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\\ (I(f):A^n\\to A)\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\\ (I(R)\\subseteq A^n)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A,I\\ \\Bigl(\\mathfrak A=(A,I)\\land A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{dom}(I)=S_L\\land\\forall c\\in L_{\\rm Const}\\ (I(c)\\in A)\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\\ (I(f):A^n\\to A)\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\\ (I(R)\\subseteq A^n)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c^{\\mathfrak A}:=I(c),\\qquad f^{\\mathfrak A}:=I(f),\\qquad R^{\\mathfrak A}:=I(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c^{\\mathfrak A}:=I(c),\\qquad f^{\\mathfrak A}:=I(f),\\qquad R^{\\mathfrak A}:=I(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>明确I是真实的解释函数及各上标记号的投影，防止旧文写出(A,I)却不将I与运算联系起来。</p>\n<p>来源：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。 此项为支撑原有形式化的一阶逻辑基础，非声称原书有独立同名定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"809479f98d99c157","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1","display":false},{"tex":"S_L","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=(A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in L_{\\rm Const}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)","display":false},{"tex":"S_L:=L_{\\rm Const}\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}(L_{\\rm Func,n}\\cup L_{\\rm Rel,n}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A,I\\ \\Bigl(\\mathfrak A=(A,I)\\land A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{dom}(I)=S_L\\land\\forall c\\in L_{\\rm Const}\\ (I(c)\\in A)\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\\ (I(f):A^n\\to A)\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\ \\forall R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\\ (I(R)\\subseteq A^n)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"c^{\\mathfrak A}:=I(c),\\qquad f^{\\mathfrak A}:=I(f),\\qquad R^{\\mathfrak A}:=I(R).","display":true}],"bytes":1826,"backlinks":[{"id":"b88be0fc886200c3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e2311665721b3454","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3238d7fca6c27a3f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-496","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-structure]] — 一阶语言的结构解释"}],"outgoing":["809479f98d99c157"]}